     <article class="story single" data-beat="national">
       <div class="meta"><span class="beat-tag">NATIONAL</span> · The Hindu · 2026-10-12 · editor 10/10 · 1 min read <span class="badge ok">fact-checked</span></div>
       <h1>Abdullapurmet Tahsildar and Surveyor Arrested for Accepting Bribe</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#national</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Anti-Corruption Bureau (ACB) arrested Abdullapurmet Tahsildar B. Sudershan Reddy and Mandal Surveyor Batuka Srinivasulu on Monday for accepting a ₹20 lakh bribe. The officials originally demanded ₹30 lakh to conduct a land survey and issue a joint inspection report required for Hyderabad Metropolitan Development Authority guidelines.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-12/abdullapurmet-tahsildar-and-surveyor-arrested-for-accepting-.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>Acting on a complaint, ACB officials set a trap where Srinivasulu was caught receiving the money on the Tahsildar's instructions. A chemical test confirmed Srinivasulu had handled the bribe funds. Both suspects are being produced before the Principal Special Judge for ACB Cases in Hyderabad as investigations continue.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: The brief accurately captures the key details of the arrest and the official charges without unnecessary filler.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.thehindu.com/news/national/telangana/abdullapurmet-tahsildar-surveyor-caught-accepting-20-lakh-bribe-in-rangareddy-district/article71576637.ece" rel="noopener">The Hindu</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
