       <h1>Drishyam The Conclusion Posts Strong Second Weekend</h1>
       <div class="tags"><span>#entertainment</span> <span>#brief</span></div>
       <p>The Ajay Devgn starrer Drishyam The Conclusion grossed Rs. 65 crore during its second weekend, maintaining strong theatrical momentum. The film earned Rs. 14.50 crore on Friday, October 9, before surging to Rs. 26.17 crore on Saturday. Sunday collections added another Rs. 24.33 crore, solidifying the franchise's appeal and audience interest in the conclusion of the Vijay Salgaonkar storyline.</p><img class="hero-art" src="/img/2026-10-12/drishyam-the-conclusion-posts-strong-second-weekend.webp" width="1200" height="675" alt="" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"><p>The film's performance suggests continued viewer interest in the suspense-driven narrative and Devgn's return as the protagonist. While Sunday saw a slight dip compared to the Saturday peak, the overall second-weekend figures remain significant. Future weekday earnings will determine the film's total sustained success.</p>
       <p class="critique">Editor's note: Accurately conveys the box office performance using the provided figures and provides necessary context without padding.</p>
       <div class="provenance">
      <b>Source</b>
      <ul><li><a href="https://www.bollywoodhungama.com/news/box-office-special-features/drishyam-the-conclusion-box-office-ajay-devgn-starrer-collects-rs-65-cr-in-second-weekend-takes-total-to-new-heights/" rel="noopener">Bollywood Hungama</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
