      <ul><li><a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/julia-child-and-her-husband-built-la-pitchoune-in-provence-in-1963-and-used-it-for-nearly-three-decades-after-she-gave-it-up-in-1992-the-home-became-a-cooking-school-where-guests-still-cook-in-her-original-kitchen/articleshow/134883400.cms" rel="noopener">Times of India</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
