      <ul><li><a href="https://www.business-standard.com/markets/news/rbi-measures-to-support-rupee-weigh-on-govt-bonds-domestic-equities-126101201121_1.html" rel="noopener">BS Personal Finance</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
