      <ul><li><a href="https://www.engadget.com/2281499/how-to-improve-blurry-iphone-photo/" rel="noopener">Engadget</a></li></ul>
      <p>AI-generated and fact-checked against the original report; claims the gate cannot verify are held back.</p>
    </div>
       
